  },
  "about": {
    "zh": "一个四分之三侧身的 Q 版旅人。银白短发上有一撮弯呆毛和一对白色毛绒尖耳，胸前垂着两束戴铜金发箍的白发。青蓝到薄荷绿的大眼睛，额前戴绿叶发冠和铜金镶浅绿宝石的坠饰。单肩披灰蓝色披肩，内穿象牙白交叠短裙，搭铜金护腕、薄荷绿宝石腰扣和绑带凉鞋。背后斜背一根顶端有浅蓝光球的短法杖，身后有蓬松白尾巴。",
    "en": "A chibi traveler in three-quarter view, with short silver-white hair, a curled cowlick, two pointed furry white ears, and two long silver locks held by brass cuffs. Large eyes shade from aqua to mint. A green leaf crown frames a pale green jewel set in brass. A slate-blue cape drapes over one shoulder above an ivory wrap skirt, with brass bracers, a mint gem belt buckle, and strapped sandals. A short staff topped with a pale blue glowing orb is slung across the back, beside a fluffy white tail."
  },
  "entry": "figure.js",
  "export": "createXingyunBody",
  "model": "model.json",
  "thumb": "thumb.png",
